sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Capture
    participant F as FaceDetector
    participant M as Measurement Modules
    participant D as DrowsinessMonitor
    participant A as AlertManager
    C->>F: send video frame
    F-->>C: landmarks or no face
    C->>M: calculate EAR and MAR
    M-->>C: measurements
    C->>D: update(EAR, MAR)
    D-->>C: status and message
    alt DROWSY
      C->>A: trigger warning
      A-->>C: overlay alert
    end
    C->>C: show or save frame
